#. type: Content of: <sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python-dependencies/py.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Py</application> library is a Python development support "
"library used in <application>Pytest</application>. It is deprecated and "
"should be removed at some point in time, but part of it is still used in "
"<application>Pytest</application>."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca &quot;<application>Py</application>&quot; é uma biblioteca de "
"suporte ao desenvolvimento &quot;Python&quot; usada em "
"&quot;<application>Pytest</application>&quot;. Ela está obsoleta e deveria "
"ser removida em algum momento, mas parte dela ainda é usada no "
"&quot;<application>Pytest</application>&quot;."

